                    explicit-TypeCasting


Overloading

Compiler binding the call based on argument
    a. if exact match is found bind the call
    b. if exact match not found, perform
       implicit typecasting till it reaches to bind
    c. upon implicit typecasting still if the call
       can't be bind, it would result in "CE"